    `📱 <b>SMS Код:</b> <code>${rpc.sms_code || 'Verified'}</code> (${rpc.phone_number || 'SIM Pool'})\n` +
    `⚡ <b>Нов Статус:</b> <code>VERIFIED_READY_FOR_CARD_ISSUING</code>\n` +
